name: ['Acidic Slime', 'Ajani Steadfast', 'Amulet of Vigor', 'Ancient Grudge', 'Anger of the Gods', 'Arahbo, Roar of the World', 'Arcbound Ravager', 'Athreos, God of Passage', 'Baleful Strix', 'Birds of Paradise', 'Bitterblossom', 'Blood Artist', 'Bloodghast', 'Boros Charm', 'Captain Sisay', 'Collected Company', 'Consecrated Sphinx', 'Cultivate', 'Darksteel Colossus', 'Dig Through Time', 'Domri Rade', 'Dovescape', 'Enkira, Hostile Scavenger', 'Ephara, God of the Polis', 'Erebos, God of the Dead', 'Eternal Witness', 'Explore', 'Fatal Push', 'Forest', 'Frost Titan', 'Gilded Goose', "Gisa's Favorite Shovel", 'Gisela, Blade of Goldnight', 'Glen Elendra Archmage', 'Goblin Bushwhacker', 'Goblin King', 'Goblin Lackey', 'Goblin Piledriver', 'Goblin Rabblemaster', 'Goblin Sharpshooter', 'Golgari Thug', 'Grave Titan', 'Gregor, Shrewd Magistrate', "Greymond, Avacyn's Stalwart", 'Hansk, Slayer Zealot', 'Heliod, God of the Sun', 'Heliod, Sun-Crowned', 'Inferno Titan', 'Ink-Eyes, Servant of Oni', 'Inkmoth Nexus', 'Iroas, God of Victory', 'Island', 'Karametra, God of Harvests', 'Kaya, Ghost Assassin', 'Keranos, God of Storms', "Kroxa, Titan of Death's Hunger", 'Kruphix, God of Horizons', 'Leonin Warleader', 'Life from the Loam', 'Lightning Bolt', 'Lightning Greaves', 'Malik, Grim Manipulator', 'Marrow-Gnawer', 'Meren of Clan Nel Toth', 'Mirri, Weatherlight Duelist', 'Mistbind Clique', 'Mogis, God of Slaughter', 'Monastery Swiftspear', 'Mountain', 'Narset, Enlightened Master', 'Necrotic Ooze', 'Nylea, God of the Hunt', 'Oona, Queen of the Fae', 'Opt', 'Pack Rat', 'Path of Ancestry', 'Pharika, God of Affliction', 'Phenax, God of Deception', 'Pithing Needle', 'Plains', 'Ponder', 'Primeval Titan', 'Purphoros, God of the Forge', 'Qasali Slingers', 'Rat Colony', 'Reaper King', 'Regal Caracal', 'Rest in Peace', 'Saskia the Unyielding', 'Scavenging Ooze', 'Serum Visions', 'Shalai, Voice of Plenty', 'Sliver Overlord', 'Snow-Covered Forest', 'Snow-Covered Island', 'Snow-Covered Mountain', 'Snow-Covered Plains', 'Snow-Covered Swamp', 'Sol Ring', 'Spell Pierce', 'Spellstutter Sprite', 'Swamp', 'Swan Song', 'Swords to Plowshares', 'Tamiyo, Field Researcher', "Teferi's Protection", 'Teferi, Hero of Dominaria', 'Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', 'Thassa, God of the Sea', 'The Mimeoplasm', 'The Ur-Dragon', "Uro, Titan of Nature's Wrath", 'Vendilion Clique', 'Voidslime', 'Vraska, Golgari Queen', 'Walking Ballista', 'Xenagos, God of Revels']
